  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's sensing and actuation interface, separating perception (uncontrollable) and motion (controllable) events. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery turns are triggered by obstacles. Recovery states are conservative and only allow directed turns or full_rotate as a last resort. The design ensures no forward or random_walk action is enabled in obstacle states, and recovery is minimal before resuming exploration.",
